1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,250
Jesus… she's stunning.

2
00:00:02,666 --> 00:00:04,458
What noble house is that?

3
00:00:04,458 --> 00:00:06,500
Why the hell would someone like
her

4
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:08,750
come to a filthy mine?

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:09,916
She's here for me.

6
00:00:12,541 --> 00:00:14,000
Severin, come on, man.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,000
If you knew someone like that,

8
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:19,083
you wouldn't be here
busting your ass with us.

9
00:00:24,625 --> 00:00:27,500
Elowen Morellan, heir of House Morellan,

10
00:00:28,708 --> 00:00:31,500
pays her respects to Lord Severin.

11
00:00:33,708 --> 00:00:35,833
The Four Great Houses...

12
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:38,500
sending their heir
to find a miner.

13
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:43,250
What do you want?

14
00:00:44,916 --> 00:00:48,375
My lord… I've admired you for so long.

15
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,833
I want to marry you.

16
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:55,541
In exchange, I offer
everything House Morellan has.

17
00:00:55,541 --> 00:00:56,833
I'm just a miner.

18
00:00:58,666 --> 00:01:00,791
There's nothing here worth that kind of price.

19
00:01:00,791 --> 00:01:03,000
My lord, I know you're tired of it all.

20
00:01:03,791 --> 00:01:06,083
You want a peace, quiet life...

21
00:01:07,375 --> 00:01:10,291
If marriage isn't what
you want, I understand.

22
00:01:10,291 --> 00:01:11,208
Just...

23
00:01:11,208 --> 00:01:12,458
let me stay.

24
00:01:12,833 --> 00:01:14,333
Let me serve you.

25
00:01:14,791 --> 00:01:16,750
I already have a fiancée.

26
00:01:19,875 --> 00:01:21,958
You filthy peasant!

27
00:01:21,958 --> 00:01:25,000
Do you know who you're refusing?!

28
00:01:47,958 --> 00:01:49,000
Sandero!

29
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,708
No. No, no, no.
